      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "女客人A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯……今年想做熔岩巧克力蛋糕，/n可是手作是不是显得太认真了？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2002101041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "女客人B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "别害羞嘛～本来就是本命！/n差不多该告白了吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2002101042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "女客人A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我哪有那个勇气～……/n不过既然难得，我也许会写封信。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2002101043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "女客人B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这个好！那我给友情巧克力也附上留言。/n啊！那边有卡片。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2002101044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（去年我也从粉丝和朋友那里收到多到双手抱不下的礼物……/n　其中最让我难忘的，还是Eden的。）",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010360",
      "CharacterMotions": [
