      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "女客人D",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这个量多，挺合适吧？/n送给平时照顾我们的人。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20021010390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2002101048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2002101,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "初魅",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（不管是不是礼节巧克力，女孩送我的东西我都会好好吃掉。/n　揣摩送礼者情感和意图的差异，也别有一番趣味。）",
